{"created": "2024-05-09T13:04:52.986073+00:00", "modified": "2024-07-29T08:00:24.011583+00:00", "id": 11163381, "conceptrecid": "11163380", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.11163381", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.11163380", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11163381", "metadata": {"title": "MSnLib Mass spectral libraries (.mgf)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.11163381", "publication_date": "2024-05-09", "description": "<p>Flow injection method to acquire MSn data on an Orbitrap ID-X instrument for four different compound libraries in positive and negative ionization mode. MS2 contains next to all MS2 spectra all pseudo MS2 spectra (a full MSn tree merged into one spectrum per compound ion). MSn contains all individual MSn stages additionally.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>4 Compound Libraries:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Short Name: Full name, Provider (Catalog number), total compounds (not all detected during library building)</li>\n<li>MCEBIO: Bioactive Compound Library, MedChemExpress (HY-L001), 10,315 compounds</li>\n<li>MCESAF: 5k Scaffold Library, MedChemExpress, (HY-L902), 4998 compounds</li>\n<li>NIHNP: NIH NPAC ACONN collection of NP, NIH/NCATS, 3988 compounds</li>\n<li>OTAVAPEP: Alpha-helix Peptiomimetic Library, OTAVAchemicals (a-helix-Peptido), 1298 compounds</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Information regarding the SPECTYPE</p>\n<ul>\n<li>no SPECTYPE: Best spectrum for each precursor and energy (highest TIC)</li>\n<li>'SAME_ENERGY' = Additionally, if a spectrum was acquired multiple times for a precursor with the same energy, they are merged into one spectrum only with the same energy (max. signal height used for each fragment signal).</li>\n<li>'ALL_ENERGIES' = merged spectrum of all used energies (in our case 3 for each precursor, using the merged (same energy) if available).</li>\n<li>'ALL_MSN_TO_PSEUDO_MS2' = mzmine merges all MSn into one pseudo MS2.</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Brungs, Corinna", "affiliation": "Czech Academy of Sciences, Institute of Organic Chemistry and Biochemistry", "orcid": "0000-0002-2571-5235"}, {"name": "Schmid, Robin", "affiliation": "Czech Academy of Sciences, Institute of Organic Chemistry and Biochemistry"}, {"name": "Pluskal, Tomas", "affiliation": "Czech Academy of Sciences, Institute of Organic Chemistry and Biochemistry"}], "keywords": ["MSnLib", "spectral database"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-l1tqh", "relation": "isPublishedIn", "scheme": "doi"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": false, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "11163380"}}]}}, "title": "MSnLib Mass spectral libraries (.mgf)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11163381", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/11163381", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/11163381?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11163381", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11163381", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.11163381", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11163381/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11163380", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/11163380", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11163380", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.11163380", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:11163381/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:11163381/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11163381/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11163381/media-files", "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11163381/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11163381/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11163381/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/11163381/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/11163381/ve